[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616023740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102070#issuecomment-2616023740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102070","id":2616023740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b7Vq8","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T15:11:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T15:11:03Z","body":"That looks super hacky. What if there is another dialog with the same problem?\r\nThere is `set_unparent_when_invisible()`, I wonder if it can be used. If not, your current solution is probably the simplest one.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616023740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616078887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102070#issuecomment-2616078887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102070","id":2616078887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b7jIn","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T15:31:28Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T16:01:44Z","body":">That looks super hacky.\r\n\r\nThe problem lies in these windows being exclusive, so to me it makes sense to reorder the windows/parents depending on the circumstances. \r\n\r\nReading out the code into plain English with reference to the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_window.html#class-window-property-exclusive).\r\n\r\nIf the editor settings dialog is open, you want the save dialog to always appear on top of it and prevent input to it specifically. Otherwise, it should do the same to the base gui.  \r\n\r\n>What if there is another dialog with the same problem?\r\n\r\nExplicitly defining which window is on-top of and blocking which parent seems to me the most straight-forward solution to the problem. I think trying to find ways to do this automatically without the window having direct knowledge of which UI it is trying to block will end up being much hackier looking by comparison. \r\n\r\n>There is set_unparent_when_invisible(), I wonder if it can be used.\r\n\r\nProbably, but you're going to have to reparent it to something depending on the circumstances anyways, so I think the result will end up looking the same but with more code, and not as clear what the intent is. That isn't to say that unparenting the window when it is invisible isn't beneficial, but it isn't clear to me what that the benefit is (saving resources?) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616078887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616347387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102070#issuecomment-2616347387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102070","id":2616347387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b8kr7","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T16:51:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T16:51:10Z","body":"> I think trying to find ways to do this automatically without the window having direct knowledge of which UI it is trying to block will end up being much hackier looking by comparison.\r\n\r\nProgressDialog already does this, the currently focused window is not difficult to find. Although manually setting the parent is safer for now I suppose.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616347387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616861976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102070#issuecomment-2616861976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102070","id":2616861976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b-iUY","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_a